<title>ISRAEL: Ten Israelis hurt in shooting from Jordan - radio.</title>
<headline>Ten Israelis hurt in shooting from Jordan - radio.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli army radio said at least 10 people were hurt when a gunman fired from Jordan across the border into Israel on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the shooting occurred near Naharayim in the Jordan Valley. There was no official confirmation of the report.  </p>
<p>Israel Radio later reported that two people were killed and many people were wounded in the shooting.</p>
</text>
